Package: lightson
Title: Download and Analyse Nighttime Lights Satellite Data
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R:
    person("Saket", "Choudhary",
           email = "saketc@iitb.ac.in",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-5202-7633"))
Description: Downloads and processes nighttime lights satellite data from
    the 'NASA' 'VIIRS' Black Marble product suite (daily, monthly, and
    annual composites; Roman et al. (2018) <doi:10.1016/j.rse.2018.03.017>)
    served by the 'LAADS DAAC' archive
    <https://ladsweb.modaps.eosdis.nasa.gov>, and from the Indian Space
    Research Organisation's 'Bhuvan' nighttime lights portal. Provides
    zonal statistics over arbitrary polygons, returning tidy region-by-time
    panels, along with plotting helpers.
